libvshadow
------------------------------------------
libvshadow is a library to access the Volume Shadow Snapshot (VSS) format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads1-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime1-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid1-20260521-1bl1
  libvshadow-devel-20260714-1bl1
  libvshadow1-20260714-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libbfio-devel-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfguid-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libvshadow

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libvshadow/archive/refs/tags/20260714.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libvshadow-20260714-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libvshadow-20260714-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libvshadow-20260714-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvshadow-20260714-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvshadow1-20260714-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libvshadow-devel-20260714-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libvshadow-20260714-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libvshadow)
  /usr/bin/vshadowdebug.exe
  /usr/bin/vshadowinfo.exe
  /usr/bin/vshadowmount.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libvshadow.README
  /usr/share/doc/libvshadow/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libvshadow/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libvshadow/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libvshadow/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libvshadow/README
  /usr/share/doc/libvshadow/Volume Shadow Snapshot (VSS) format.asciidoc
  /usr/share/man/man1/vshadowinfo.1.gz
  /usr/share/man/man1/vshadowmount.1.gz

(libvshadow1)
  /usr/bin/cygvshadow-1.dll

(libvshadow-devel)
  /usr/include/libvshadow.h
  /usr/include/libvshadow/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libvshadow/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libvshadow/error.h
  /usr/include/libvshadow/extern.h
  /usr/include/libvshadow/features.h
  /usr/include/libvshadow/types.h
  /usr/lib/libvshadow.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libvshadow.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libvshadow.3.gz

(python312-libvshadow)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyvshadow.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll

